const vocabulary=[["用戶","使用者"],["點擊","點選"],["單擊","按一下"],["數據","資料"],["信息","資訊"],["網絡","網路"],["交互","互動"],["概率","機率"],["本地記錄","瀏覽器紀錄"],["本地保存","儲存在瀏覽器"],["記錄","紀錄"],["選中","選取"],["稱量","秤重"],["稱重","秤重"],["保存","儲存"],["提交","送出"],["屏幕","螢幕"],["“","「"],["”","」"],["‘","『"],["’","』"]];
export function toTaiwanText(input){
 const source=String(input);if(Object.hasOwn(copies,source))return copies[source];
 let result=[...source].map(c=>characters[c]??c).join('');
 result=result.replace(/(?<!演)算法/g,'演算法');
 for(const [from,to] of vocabulary)result=result.split(from).join(to);
 return result;
}
